        <p>SAFETIES! SAFETIES!! SAFETIES!! CHEAPER THAN EVER. Most Wonderful Bargains ever offered. 1.000 Machines, New and Second-hand, in stock; Single Machines at Whole- sale Price. 50 per cent, cheaper than other makers. Write at once for large List, post free, from W. R. WARRILOW, Regent-street Safety Works. Weston-super-Mare.</p>
        <p>AJAX CYCLES.—Prices £3 to £2s.—Pneumatic and Cushion SAFETIES and TRICYCLES in great variety. All interested in Cycles should write for our 200 page Lists for 1894 of over 1,000 New and Second-hand Pneumatic, Cushion, and Solid-tyre Safeties. Bicycles, and Tricycles, and about 5.000 unsolicited iestirnonials post-free, Large discount for cash, or easy terms from 10s. per month. Machin« s sent Carriage paid, to purchaser's address. BRITISH CYCLE MANUFACTURING COMPANY, 45, EVERTOR ROAD, LIVERPOOL.</p>
        <p>THE OLD-ESTABLISHED BASSINETTE WAREHOUSE. Beware of spurious imitations. The best and cheapest Carriages in the town or district. (No connection with any other firm of the same name.) WASHTON,74, Sankev-st., Warrington, manu- • facturer of Bath Chaiiv, Bassinettes. Rustic Carri- ages, &amp;c., of the best materials and workmanship, on the premises, under personal supervision. Well-finished Bassinettes from 258., warranted to run straight. Mail Carts, Tricycle Horses, Doll Carriages, &amp;c. Agent for Sewing Machines, Wringing and Washing Machines. WORKS :—BEAMON'DoSTREET. THE</p>
