        <head>PLEASANT PkVAGRAPHS,</head>
        <p>PLEASANT PkVAGRAPHS,</p>
        <p>THE bill-poster knows: his place, and there he sticks. "WERE you upset by the bank failure '!" " Yes ; I lost my balance. SOME men, if they it up-by having ak:</p>
        <p>:e one swallow, must followc</p>
