        <p>impudence Ke: "What's your height?" "L BELIEVE in taking things quietly, as the philosophical pickpocket remarked. AN indivithial who employs a great number of " hands " in Ins business: The professional auto- graph-hunter. WHEN we dont't spend</p>
        <p>our money, we .are</p>
        <p>Money, they are stingy. CABBY (to masher, whom he has driven two miles): Wot ! a whole shillin' ! I wonder yer mother trusted yer with so much.</p>
        <p>ON receipt of a new lot of smoked tongues, a facetious grocer announces on a placard at his door, "A fresh stock of choice lickers."</p>
        <p>JUST So —" What sort of a girl is sh• 3 "Oh, she is a miss with a mission." "Au "And her mission is seeking a man with a mansion."</p>
        <p>FROM ANOTHER POINT, -,OF VIEW. —When we COUSider the matter fully, a: bird in the bush thinks himself. Worth a dear More ,than two in the hand. THE blonde—" I wonder if I shall ever live to be a hundred,?" The brunette—" Not if you remain twenty-two much longer."</p>
