        <p>MANCHESTER GENTLEMAN,' 11. having a large amount of Uninvested CAPITAL at his command is prepared to ADVANCIG same to responsible Persons in Sums of £lO to £lOOO, On the Borrower's simple written promise to repay ; Without Sureties, Delay. Law Costs or Publicity. Also on Deeds, Life Polici,s, Ac., at 5 per cent interest. The amount Borrowed can be repaid by easy instalments or capital can remain so long as the interest is paid, as this office is a bonn-fide private concern and not connected with any Loan Office. It is request-d that habitual borrowers will not apply. For full particulars apply pet smokily or by letter to J. CAMPBELL, ESQ., MAN.. HESTER CIIAMBHP.S, 464, MARKBT-nIiEET, 14ANCHBSTBR.</p>
