        <p>LEGH CHALLENGE CUP COMPETITION.</p>
        <p>The following matches were played in this competi- tion on Saturday : VIADUCT INSTITUTE T. NORTH ASHTON.—The Institute concluded their fixtures in the competition by meeting and defeating North Ashton, the champions. Great credit is dueito the Institute from the fact that North Ashton have not been beaten by any club during the past seven years. The bowling on Saturday was much above the average and was greatly appreciated by the large number who witnessed the games. The Institute have played nine matches, won six, and lost three,which gives them third place, with 12 points ; last year they occupied fifth position. They have scored during the season 2,440 points against 2,354 by their opponents. The following are the scores on Saturday : AT EARLESTOWN. INSTITUTE.</p>
