        <p>HALTON v. WINNINGTON PARK.—A match between these teams took place on the green of the Norton Arms Hotel, Halton, on Saturday afternoon, Halton gaining the victory by 95. Score : . WINNINGTON PIM 1111,1oN. Sing. D'ble. Sing. D'ble. G Malatn %V Whitby T Tomlinson ... 1 I T Wilkinson 4 G Starkey F Stringfellow 1 t HiJoh; son. ...... 13 3 G Cc)ombs H Reeves 9 I 7 W Dugdale l3 R Norcross .... . 6 J T Hankey R Bowdon -;8 } 15 W Bowden l3 T Whitby M Brown lO 1 12 T Richardson... 13 J Hughes W Hughes S Forster ..... 13 f 12 IC Clarke lO C Stringfellow 13 I. „ W Ray 8 C Hinton lO J " W Hassall ..... 13</p>
