        <p>BIRTHS. the PEnnzirron—August 20th, at 3, White-st.. Warrksgth); wife of Mr. Thos. Pemberton, of a daughter. . liervu CHANTLICR.—Anguat 15th, at the " Adelphi sots' street, Warrington, the wife of James Chanties oi MARRIAGES. POBWETT—GARXETT. August 30th, at the Wedie,-- rolirp Penketh, by the Rev. Robert Posnett. father of t"A 10,A groom, assisted by the Revs. Joseph Fo3Elett SP: 00_1; Gunnell, Robert H. Posnett. Runcorn, to daughter of Robert Garnett, Req., d.P.. HO so° keth, Warrington. 10-,ff HOWARD—Lowx—August 19th. at the !Nem rington, by the Rev. A. A. Markhun, Frederick Mary Alice Lowe. h ciArwa Yonno—Hou.ownix—August 19th, at the Paris- yoa Warrington, by the Rev. A. A. Markham, Lawreav" _ to Annie Hollowell. • DEATHS. „ iiirk‘rfso CHALn. —On the 30th August. at " Hazeldene• trboon":4o Southport, William Chalk. J.P. (of the firm of</p>
